{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>TRATAKA 是一款專為專注與放鬆設計的燭光冥想應用，適合需要平靜心境或練習正念的用戶。現於 App Store 提供<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，讓你無需付費即可體驗高品質的冥想輔助工具。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-240.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>逼真3D燭火體驗</h2>\n<p>透過逼真的 3D 蠟燭介面，用戶可滑動調整角度、雙擊放大火焰細節並自定義動態。支援 5 至 20 分鐘及自訂時長，提供靜音、三種環境音效或播放個人音樂選項。無帳號註冊、無廣告且隱私保護完善，助你在螢幕常亮下進入深度放鬆狀態。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-233-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-234-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-235-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-236-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1177\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2622x1206bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1177\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2622x1206bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：TRATAKA: Candle Meditation</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/trataka-candle-meditation/id6818603452?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.324973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:45:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:57:36.419065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:34.142059+00:00","content_hash":"c85e5834cf0b80d82d4fc0fa9ba8958d766a771900b08ee7a7cfaebfc3d397cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}